{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/220852-things-cultists-are-not-permitted-to-do-while-serving-the-arisen-and-the-judges","id":220852,"title":"Things Cultists are not permitted to do while serving the Arisen and the Judges.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-07T00:50:08-07:00","id":220852,"title":"Things Cultists are not permitted to do while serving the Arisen and the Judges.","content":"Just because you have minions willing to die for you does not mean that the minions are always competent or remotely intelligent, has many an evil overlord will attest to. Below are some hopefully uncommon managerial issues your Arisen may encounter while guiding a Cult of mortals.<br /> <br /> <br /> * &quot;Alright minions, I don't know what a 'labor union' is, but you're sworn to serve me in life and death until the next Sothic Turn, and part of that is not refusing to do my will unless you get health insurance and free coffee and bagels in the break room. I don't even know WHY we have a break room, and I certainly don't know why you fools thought it was a good idea to put my canopic jars under the sink in there. I found a RAT sleeping on what used to be my liver.&quot; <br /> * &quot;Yes, there are other supernaturals. No, you cannot defect because of your attachment to Grimms Faerie Tales, the Furry Fandom, or whatever the hell 'twilight' is.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Dilbert comics are an affront to the Judges and are no longer permitted in the work place, any comparisons to the character 'catbert' made has a result of this will be met with being sent on Suicide Missions until something sticks.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Having seen those movies, and determining that the whole thing with flesh eating Scarabs is a pretty good idea, I am rescinding my 'kill on sight' order for Brendan Fraiser.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Do not taunt the boxes of flesh eating Scarabs, do not ask where I got the flesh eating Scarabs, do not attempt to fornicate with the flesh eating Scarabs. I wish none of this needed to be said, but this is not the world I have awakened to.&quot;<br /> * &quot;The 'x days until the Master runs out of Sekhem' calendar hanging in the break room has been stuffed into the esophagus of the cultist who hung it up to begin with. Please make a note of this.&quot;<br /> * &quot;I don't care if 'the Ghouls get it', you can't have access to profane magic from beyond proper reality. We tried that once last turn, and all it did was cause a lot of heads to explode and supplied the British Museum with some very strange exhibit pieces.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Just because you assume all Egyptians ran around half naked at all times does not mean this is remotely accurate, and it assuredly does NOT mean you need to do this. Buy a gym subscription, then we'll talk.&quot;<br /> * &quot;If its furry and has claws the size of steak knives, do not try to bring them into the Cult. We're still trying to figure out how to fix claw marks in a three millennium old stone column without hiring outside contractors.&quot;<br /> * &quot;When I bring a rival Arisen to show the splendor of my relics and the favor the judges have shown me, it is NOT the time for a baby shower. Yes, we're all glad Karen is pregnant and will soon produce a new acolyte of our cult, but those pink fetus balloons utterly destroyed the atmosphere.&quot;<br /> * &quot;'My kid has a thing' is not a valid excuse to miss rituals and prayer sessions that require precise timing during an event that happens only once every few centuries. There are other Little League games, there's only one Transit of Venus.&quot;<br /> * &quot;You are paid in assurance that the Judges will reward you for your service in the next life, I have no idea what stock options are and do not care to learn.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Please do not use my sacred relics to re-enact fights from movies, anime, or video games unless you like the idea of doing such to the death.&quot; <br /> * &quot;'I was totally going to get some strange' is not an excuse to bring loose women to my tomb in the dead of night without seeing fit to have them pledge loyalty to Duat first.&quot; <br /> * &quot;I don't know who those people who keep asking if I have a moment for a dead carpenter from two millennia ago every Sunday are, but I want them either dead or deported to somewhere very cold and unpleasant.&quot; <br /> * &quot;No, I am not a terrorist. And the next person to invite a redneck to my tomb for initiation will be eviscerated and fed to the Awakened Thralls.&quot;<br /> * &quot;While I appreciate the effort, I personally knew Tutankhamen and he was not a 'total poser' and a 'mad pussy'.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Cats are sacred to the EGYPTIANS, and have nothing to do with Iremite legend. So please quit leaving bowls of cat food out, they've made an utter mess of the walls of my tomb, and the entire place smells like a trailer park.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Utterances, Affinities, Relics, and other Iremite magic is NOT for porn. I don't care what your Grandfather told you I did with the High Priestess back in the 1800s, comely though she was.&quot;<br /> * &quot;Any 'doujins' of the above are to be burned immediately, regardless of age or quality of content. And if I find out you put them online, I will personally feed you to Ammut.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1645-autochthon","name":"Autochthon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-07T11:51:26-07:00","id":221171,"title":"","content":"* &quot;Christopher Nolan's entire filmography is banned from movie night. The Sadikh is inconsolable after watching <i>Memento</i> and <i>Inception</i>, and I shall have to procure a new one. In addition, all films must be approved before being brought into the tomb for viewing.&quot;<br /> <br /> * &quot;When I discover who used my sahu's remains as a Halloween decoration last year before I was awakened, their punishment will make the Devourer's Jaws seem a merciful alternative. Any cultist who reveals information about the culprit shall be rewarded with temporal pleasures beyond their imagining.&quot;<br /> <br /> * &quot;After having seen that movie, I am instating a 'kill on sight' order for Bruce Campbell, Ossie Davis, and Don Coscarelli.&quot;<br /> <br /> * &quot;While I appreciate the sentiment, a wedding ceremony is not an appropriate opener for the Ritual of Awakening. I will not apologize for the accident last month: you should have known better. Perhaps future spouses will be initiated into the cult <i>first</i>.&quot;<br /> <br /> * &quot;Regardless of your accomplishments in the Judges' service, neither I nor my Sadikh are appropriate references to put on your resume, nor will I write any letters of recommendation for you.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T10:43:36-07:00","id":227139,"title":"","content":"* &quot;Though I appreciate the sentiment, please refrain from throwing toilet paper, spoiled eggs, and rotten fruit at rival tombs. Yes, burnt offerings are proper offerings of appeasement, but please be realistic about what you are putting in those brown paper bags.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T05:28:09-07:00","id":227778,"title":"","content":"* &quot;If I become Twice-Arisen, it will be because of a failure of great magnitude that leaves my sahu unsuitable for habitation by my spirit, likely after a great battle with one of the Lifeless, a powerful Amkhata, or those hubris-laden fools at LDI. It will <i>not</i> be because you want me to inhabit the body of a celebrity, or think that I'm looking old and flabby these days. You are not being subtle and it is getting <i>annoying</i>.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-14T09:25:22-07:00","id":228064,"title":"","content":"* &quot;Again, my canopic jars hold my organs. Not protein powder.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}